# YallaWin

- Read Agent.md, IDEA.md, and RULES.md before large changes.
- React function components. Prefer `useState` and `useEffect`.
- All static lists and labels go in `src/data/data.js`.
- New screens are React Router routes in `src/App.jsx`.
- Explain each component in a top comment and in `docs/COMPONENTS.md`.
- Follow the taste skill in `.cursor/skills/taste/SKILL.md`.
